 challenger in battle godfrey's  warrior spirit left him along with his  grace  the light surrounding his body and the  energy imbued by the earth tree fled  godfrey's spirit  leaving him broken  having been rejected by the earth tree  america had little choice but to exile  godfrey from the lands between making  him the first tarnished  since then a number of others who have  been affected in the same way were also  banished from the lands  [Music]  eventually an event that would be known  as the shattering would change the face  of the lands between forever  this was on the night of the black  knives where a claim of mysterious  assassins invaded killing many including  america's eldest born  during the fighting the elden ring was  somehow damaged and shattered fragments  of the rings splinted into great ruins  and spread across the lands between  starting a conflict between america's  demigod children to determine who would  be america's successor  the end result of the war was a  stalemate between numerous factions  many demigods now have great ruins  scavenged from the damaged elden ring  but none have properly risen to power to  either replace america or become the new  elden lord  this pointless middle ground caused the  elden ring's blessing to partially fade  from the lands between  centuries have passed  tarnished are now being called back to  the lands between by the earth tree in  an attempt to break the stalemate  most tarnish can only faintly perceive  the grace and lose sight of it  altogether after arriving in the lands  between  this leaves them directionless and  without hope  some of these tarnished go on to fall  prey to a form of corruption called cis  blood  becoming frenzied killers who  obsessively hunt their fellow tarnished  other tarnished who prove themselves are  given passage to the round table hold a  hidden place of refuge where violence  between tarnished is forbidden  and then there is a very small amount of  tarnished who were chosen to be  sponsored by a finger maiden a human  representative of the two fingers  granting them the power to convert ruins  to strength  setting them on the path to becoming the  new elden lord by seizing the great  runes from the demigods and restoring  the elden ring  so to answer the question  all of the tarnished in the lands  between originally became exiled because  they'd fallen from grace in one way or  another  they are individuals who no longer have  the life force of the earth tree running  through them  being labeled as tarnished is a title  that brings great shame  however individual tarnished have now  been given the opportunity to grow in  strength and power by collecting the  great runes repairing the elden ring and  becoming the new elden lord  changing this damaged realm to reflect  the ideals and desires of whatever side  they are working with  this was my first installment for this  game so i wanted to keep it relatively  simple and straightforward  i have purposely been quite ambiguous  with a lot of what i've said in order to  stick to the question at hand but also  to keep the spoilers to a minimum i'll  certainly be expanding on some of what  i've talked about here later on  i'm somewhat testing the waters here  with this video this is a genre i really  haven't covered before and i'm not  really sure of what interests my  followers will have with this however as  far as the game goes i'm completely  hooked so regardless of the outcome i  think this will be my next obsession for  a little while  anyway thank you very much for watching  and i'll catch in the next one cheers  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

